This package bundles third-party sources.

DuckHTS DuckDB extension
	Source: inst/duckhts_extension (files other than the third-party trees below)
	Authors: DuckHTS contributors
	License: MIT
	Reference: https://github.com/RGenomicsETL/duckhts/blob/main/LICENSE

HTSlib
	Source: inst/duckhts_extension/htslib
	Authors: Genome Research Ltd and contributors (see LICENSE in that directory)
	License: MIT/Expat for files outside cram/ and Modified BSD 3-Clause for cram/
	Reference: inst/duckhts_extension/htslib/LICENSE

DuckDB C API headers
	Source: inst/duckhts_extension/duckdb_capi/duckdb.h and duckdb_extension.h
	Authors: DuckDB contributors
	License: See the DuckDB project license for the version of these headers

VariantKey / RegionKey C API
	Source: inst/duckhts_extension/include/variantkey/{hex.h,variantkey.h,regionkey.h}
	Authors: Nicola Asuni and contributors
	License: MIT
	Reference: inst/duckhts_extension/include/variantkey/variantkey.h and inst/duckhts_extension/include/variantkey/regionkey.h

libBigWig
	Source: inst/duckhts_extension/libBigWig
	Author: Devon Ryan
	License: MIT
	Reference: inst/duckhts_extension/libBigWig/LICENSE

Mosdepth test fixtures
	Source: inst/extdata/{bad.bed,big.bam,empty-tids.*,full-fragment-pairs.*,missing.bed,nanopore.*,overlapping-pairs.*,ovl.*,track.bed,unordered.bed}
	Authors: Brent Pedersen and mosdepth contributors
	License: MIT
	Reference: upstream mosdepth project LICENSE

Somalier-derived numerical methods
	Source: inst/duckhts_extension/somalier.c
	Author: Brent Pedersen and Somalier contributors
	License: MIT
	Reference: Somalier v0.3.4, commit ff58fdade8f4f8293d904f10e0a4a13f1fac808d
	Note: DuckHTS ports a defined computational subset; no Somalier Nim source or .somalier store is bundled.

GenBank test fixtures
	Source: inst/extdata/phix174.gb, inst/extdata/genbank_phase.gb, inst/extdata/genbank_gene_order.gb
	Authors: NCBI RefSeq record NC_001422.1 (Escherichia phage phiX174); the genbank_*.gb records are hand-written probes
	License: NCBI places no restrictions on the use or distribution of sequence records
	Reference: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nuccore/NC_001422.1
